# Code owners for access configuration.
# See: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# catalog-info.yaml declares who owns this repository and which teams may
# access it. Its code owner should be the owning team named in spec.owner,
# so that team reviews access changes up to `write`. The Backstage templates
# add that line at enrollment; when adding this file by hand, append:
#
#   /catalog-info.yaml @geolonia/<owner-team>
#
# Grants of `maintain` or `admin` additionally need an approving review from
# @geolonia/operations on the pull request; the central team-access sync
# checks for it and skips the grant otherwise.

/.github/CODEOWNERS @geolonia/operations
/catalog-info.yaml @geolonia/geonicdb
